  "title": "FORMFACTOR, INC. SELECTS FARMERS BRANCH, TEXAS AS SITE FOR NEW ADVANCED MANUFACTURING FACILITY",
  "summary": "Farmers Branch, TX and Livermore, CA – November 12, 2025 – The City of Farmers Branch, Texas and FormFactor, Inc. (NASDAQ: FORM) today announced that FormFactor, a leading global supplier of test and measurement technologies for the semiconductor industry, has begun site work and equipment installation for its new Farmers Branch advanced manufacturing facility. This… Continue reading FORMFACTOR, INC. SELECTS FARMERS BRANCH, TEXAS AS SITE FOR NEW ADVANCED MANUFACTURING FACILITY",
